{"id": "g3_twice_covered_integers_closed_spans", "signature": "solve(spans)", "statement": "`spans` is a list of [start, end] pairs of integers with start <= end, each describing a CLOSED range that contains every integer from start to end inclusive. Return the number of integers that are covered by at least TWO spans, counting multiplicity: a span listed twice covers its integers twice. Spans may overlap, touch, repeat, or appear in any order, and the input list must not be modified. Return 0 for an empty list.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[1, 1]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[1, 1], [1, 1]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [2, 5]]], "expected": 2}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [3, 5]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [4, 5]]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[[0, 0], [0, 0], [0, 0]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[-3, 3], [0, 6]]], "expected": 4}, {"args": [[[1, 5], [3, 7], [6, 6]]], "expected": 4}, {"args": [[[10, 20], [20, 30], [15, 16], [40, 40]]], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[[2, 9], [9, 9], [2, 2]]], "expected": 2}, {"args": [[[18, 22], [14, 17], [-8, -2], [7, 12], [21, 25]]], "expected": 2}, {"args": [[[19, 21], [-3, -3], [15, 15], [20, 21], [19, 22]]], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[[13, 15], [21, 24], [30, 34], [23, 26], [4, 5], [-6, -5], [-3, 3], [1, 6]]], "expected": 7}, {"args": [[[-9, -5], [0, 5], [-5, -5], [23, 24], [30, 35], [13, 14], [25, 27]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[16, 21], [-9, -4], [-10, -7], [-3, -3], [16, 20]]], "expected": 8}, {"args": [[[21, 24], [2, 6], [-4, -2], [-10, -10], [24, 25]]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[[15, 17], [27, 33], [6, 6], [-4, 0], [7, 8], [12, 14], [18, 21], [16, 19]]], "expected": 4}], "facts": [["arg", "spans", "interval_list"], ["iterate", "spans"], ["ask", "covered_length"], ["interval_ends", "closed"], ["min_depth", "2"], ["size", "spans", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["interval_scan"], "uses": ["interval_covered_length"], "solution_sha256": "1623d2399ac05167968b6333587d35302fbf7adc40159c9e0218039aa1bfb675", "reference_sha256": "515702ebb73ba181497a49aa0b08892ad2d9fb0b8863d86842879d62065e8190"}}